{"slug":"/students/subjects/chemistry/electrochemistry-redox/balancing-redox/","source":"students/subjects/chemistry/electrochemistry-redox/balancing-redox.html","area":"students","kind":"topic","title":"Balancing Redox Equations | Chemistry","description":"","subject":"chemistry","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/chemistry/electrochemistry-redox/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 transition flex items-center\">\n        <span class=\"mi -arrow-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>Back to Electrochemistry &amp; Redox\n      </a>\n      <!-- Progress indicator -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">\n          <span id=\"topic-progress-text\" data-bidemy=\"progress-text\">0% Complete</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-24 h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden\" data-bidemy=\"progress\">\n          <div id=\"topic-progress-bar\" class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-400 to-purple-500 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width: 0%\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n    \n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-lg\">\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"border-b pb-4 mb-6\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">\n          <span class=\"mi -balance-scale text-purple-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"balance\">balance</span>Balancing Redox Equations\n        </h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Mastering the half-reaction method for balancing complex redox equations in acidic and basic conditions.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n      <div id=\"objectives\" class=\"bg-violet-50 border-l-4 border-violet-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-violet-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n        <ul class=\"text-violet-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n          <li>• Identify oxidation and reduction half-reactions</li>\n          <li>• Balance redox equations using the half-reaction method</li>\n          <li>• Balance equations in acidic conditions</li>\n          <li>• Adapt balanced equations for basic conditions</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: The Half-Reaction Method -->\n      <section id=\"section-1\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">1</span>\n          The Half-Reaction Method\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">The <strong class=\"text-violet-600\">half-reaction method</strong> breaks down the redox equation into two separate half-reactions (oxidation and reduction), balances each individually, then combines them.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 mt-3\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\">Key Steps Overview:</p>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">1</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Identify and separate oxidation and reduction half-reactions</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">2</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Balance all atoms except O and H</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">3</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Balance O atoms using H₂O</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">4</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Balance H atoms using H⁺ (acidic) or H₂O/OH⁻ (basic)</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">5</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Balance charge using electrons (e⁻)</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">6</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Multiply half-reactions to equalize electrons</p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 rounded-full w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-xs font-bold\">7</span>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-700 text-sm\">Add half-reactions and simplify</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Visual Flowchart -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 180\" class=\"w-full max-w-md mx-auto\">\n              <!-- Start -->\n              <rect x=\"150\" y=\"5\" width=\"100\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" rx=\"12\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"white\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\">Unbalanced Equation</text>\n              \n              <!-- Arrow down -->\n              <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n              \n              <!-- Split box -->\n              <rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#fee2e2\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"110\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\">Oxidation</text>\n              <text x=\"110\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-size=\"8\">Half-reaction</text>\n              \n              <rect x=\"230\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"290\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\">Reduction</text>\n              <text x=\"290\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-size=\"8\">Half-reaction</text>\n              \n              <!-- Split arrows -->\n              <path d=\"M 200 45 L 110 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n              <path d=\"M 200 45 L 290 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n              \n              <!-- Balance each -->\n              <rect x=\"50\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"110\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#92400e\" font-size=\"8\">Balance atoms &amp; e⁻</text>\n              \n              <rect x=\"230\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"290\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#92400e\" font-size=\"8\">Balance atoms &amp; e⁻</text>\n              \n              <!-- Merge arrows -->\n              <path d=\"M 110 120 L 200 135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n              <path d=\"M 290 120 L 200 135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n              \n              <!-- Combine -->\n              <rect x=\"130\" y=\"140\" width=\"140\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"200\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\">Combine &amp; Simplify</text>\n              <text x=\"200\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#16a34a\" font-size=\"8\">Balanced Equation</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Balancing in Acidic Conditions -->\n      <section id=\"section-2\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">2</span>\n          Balancing in Acidic Conditions\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">In acidic solution, we use <strong class=\"text-violet-600\">H₂O</strong> to balance oxygen and <strong class=\"text-violet-600\">H⁺</strong> to balance hydrogen.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-red-800 text-sm\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb mr-2 text-yellow-500\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span><strong>Memory Tip:</strong> In acidic conditions, if you need oxygen, add H₂O. If you need hydrogen, add H⁺.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 1 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full p-4 bg-violet-50 text-left font-semibold text-violet-800 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-violet-100 transition\">\n            <span><span class=\"mi -flask mr-2 text-green-500\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Worked Example: Acidic Solution</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transform transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-5\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Balance: MnO₄⁻ + Fe²⁺ → Mn²⁺ + Fe³⁺ (acidic)</p>\n              \n              <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-violet-500\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify half-reactions</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-red-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">Oxidation: Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-blue-700 font-mono text-sm\">Reduction: MnO₄⁻ → Mn²⁺</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-violet-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Balance oxidation half-reaction</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺ + e⁻</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1\">(Fe already balanced, just add electron)</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-violet-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Balance reduction half-reaction (O then H then charge)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">MnO₄⁻ → Mn²⁺</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono text-sm\">MnO₄⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O (balance O)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono text-sm\">MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O (balance H)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono text-sm\">MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 5e⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O (balance charge)</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-violet-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Equalize electrons (5 × oxidation)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">5Fe²⁺ → 5Fe³⁺ + 5e⁻</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-violet-700 font-mono text-sm\">MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 5e⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                  <p class=\"text-green-800 font-semibold\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Final Balanced Equation:</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-green-700 font-mono\">MnO₄⁻ + 5Fe²⁺ + 8H⁺ → Mn²⁺ + 5Fe³⁺ + 4H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 2 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full p-4 bg-pink-50 text-left font-semibold text-pink-800 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-pink-100 transition\">\n            <span><span class=\"mi -flask mr-2 text-green-500\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Worked Example: Dichromate</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transform transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-5\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Balance: Cr₂O₇²⁻ + I⁻ → Cr³⁺ + I₂ (acidic)</p>\n              \n              <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-pink-500\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify half-reactions</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-red-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">Oxidation: I⁻ → I₂</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-blue-700 font-mono text-sm\">Reduction: Cr₂O₇²⁻ → Cr³⁺</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-pink-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Balance oxidation</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">2I⁻ → I₂ + 2e⁻</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-pink-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Balance reduction</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">Cr₂O₇²⁻ → 2Cr³⁺ (balance Cr)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono text-sm\">Cr₂O₇²⁻ → 2Cr³⁺ + 7H₂O (balance O)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono text-sm\">Cr₂O₇²⁻ + 14H⁺ → 2Cr³⁺ + 7H₂O (balance H)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono text-sm\">Cr₂O₇²⁻ + 14H⁺ + 6e⁻ → 2Cr³⁺ + 7H₂O (balance charge)</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-pink-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Equalize electrons (multiply oxidation by 3)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-pink-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">6I⁻ → 3I₂ + 6e⁻</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                  <p class=\"text-green-800 font-semibold\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Final Balanced Equation:</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-green-700 font-mono\">Cr₂O₇²⁻ + 6I⁻ + 14H⁺ → 2Cr³⁺ + 3I₂ + 7H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Balancing in Basic Conditions -->\n      <section id=\"section-3\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">3</span>\n          Balancing in Basic Conditions\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\">For basic solutions, first balance as if in acidic conditions, then neutralize the H⁺ ions by adding OH⁻ to both sides.</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-blue-800 text-sm\"><span class=\"mi -info-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span><strong>Key Rule:</strong> Add the same number of OH⁻ as H⁺ to BOTH sides. H⁺ + OH⁻ → H₂O</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 3 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full p-4 bg-indigo-50 text-left font-semibold text-indigo-800 flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-indigo-100 transition\">\n            <span><span class=\"mi -flask mr-2 text-green-500\" data-mi=\"science\">science</span>Worked Example: Basic Solution</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transform transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-5\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Balance: MnO₄⁻ + I⁻ → MnO₂ + I₂ (basic)</p>\n              \n              <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-indigo-500\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Balance as if acidic first</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">Oxidation: 2I⁻ → I₂ + 2e⁻</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono text-sm\">Reduction: MnO₄⁻ + 4H⁺ + 3e⁻ → MnO₂ + 2H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-indigo-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Equalize electrons (multiply by 3 and 2)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">6I⁻ → 3I₂ + 6e⁻</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono text-sm\">2MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 6e⁻ → 2MnO₂ + 4H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-indigo-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add half-reactions (acidic form)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">2MnO₄⁻ + 6I⁻ + 8H⁺ → 2MnO₂ + 3I₂ + 4H₂O</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-indigo-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Neutralize H⁺ by adding 8OH⁻ to both sides</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">2MnO₄⁻ + 6I⁻ + 8H⁺ + 8OH⁻ → 2MnO₂ + 3I₂ + 4H₂O + 8OH⁻</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono text-sm\">2MnO₄⁻ + 6I⁻ + 8H₂O → 2MnO₂ + 3I₂ + 4H₂O + 8OH⁻</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"step-card bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded border-l-4 border-indigo-400\">\n                  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\"><strong>Step 5:</strong> Simplify (cancel 4H₂O)</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-1 text-sm\">2MnO₄⁻ + 6I⁻ + 4H₂O → 2MnO₂ + 3I₂ + 8OH⁻</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded-lg\">\n                  <p class=\"text-green-800 font-semibold\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Final Balanced Equation (Basic):</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-green-700 font-mono\">2MnO₄⁻ + 6I⁻ + 4H₂O → 2MnO₂ + 3I₂ + 8OH⁻</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Quick Reference and Tips -->\n      <section id=\"section-4\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-violet-100 text-violet-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm font-bold\">4</span>\n          Quick Reference &amp; Common Mistakes\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -check-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"check_circle\">check_circle</span>Remember</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-green-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n              <li>• Balance atoms first, then charge</li>\n              <li>• Electrons go on the more positive side</li>\n              <li>• Check that electrons lost = electrons gained</li>\n              <li>• Verify: atoms and charge balanced on both sides</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -times-circle mr-2\" data-mi=\"cancel\">cancel</span>Common Mistakes</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-red-700 text-sm space-y-1\">\n              <li>• Forgetting to balance O and H atoms</li>\n              <li>• Not multiplying by correct factor for electrons</li>\n              <li>• Adding OH⁻ to only one side (basic conditions)</li>\n              <li>• Canceling incorrectly when simplifying</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Summary Table -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -table mr-2 text-blue-500\" data-mi=\"table_chart\">table_chart</span>Summary: Acidic vs Basic Conditions</h4>\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-100\">\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-left\">Aspect</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">Acidic Conditions</th>\n                  <th class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">Basic Conditions</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2\">Balance O</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">Add H₂O</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">Add H₂O</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"bg-gray-50\">\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2\">Balance H</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">Add H⁺</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">First add H⁺, then neutralize with OH⁻</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2\">Final check</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">H⁺ should appear on one side</td>\n                  <td class=\"border border-gray-300 p-2 text-center\">OH⁻ should appear; no H⁺</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 5: Practice Problems -->\n      <section id=\"section-5\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt text-blue-600 mr-3\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n          Practice Problems\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Balance in acidic solution:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-gray-700\">H₂O₂ + Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺ + H₂O</p>\n            <details class=\"mt-2\">\n              <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Solution</summary>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                <p>Oxidation: 2Fe²⁺ → 2Fe³⁺ + 2e⁻</p>\n                <p>Reduction: H₂O₂ + 2H⁺ + 2e⁻ → 2H₂O</p>\n                <p class=\"font-semibold mt-2\">H₂O₂ + 2Fe²⁺ + 2H⁺ → 2Fe³⁺ + 2H₂O</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Balance in acidic solution:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-gray-700\">MnO₄⁻ + C₂O₄²⁻ → Mn²⁺ + CO₂</p>\n            <details class=\"mt-2\">\n              <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Solution</summary>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                <p>Oxidation: C₂O₄²⁻ → 2CO₂ + 2e⁻</p>\n                <p>Reduction: MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ + 5e⁻ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O</p>\n                <p>Multiply oxidation by 5, reduction by 2</p>\n                <p class=\"font-semibold mt-2\">2MnO₄⁻ + 5C₂O₄²⁻ + 16H⁺ → 2Mn²⁺ + 10CO₂ + 8H₂O</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Balance in basic solution:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-gray-700\">Cl₂ → Cl⁻ + ClO⁻</p>\n            <details class=\"mt-2\">\n              <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Solution</summary>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                <p>This is a disproportionation reaction (Cl is both oxidized and reduced)</p>\n                <p>Reduction: Cl₂ + 2e⁻ → 2Cl⁻</p>\n                <p>Oxidation: Cl₂ + 4H₂O → 2ClO⁻ + 8H⁺ + 6e⁻</p>\n                <p>For basic: multiply oxidation by 3, add 8OH⁻ to both sides</p>\n                <p class=\"font-semibold mt-2\">3Cl₂ + 6OH⁻ → 5Cl⁻ + ClO₃⁻ + 3H₂O</p>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\">Note: ClO⁻ disproportionates further to ClO₃⁻ in basic solution</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Balance in acidic solution:</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-gray-700\">NO₃⁻ + Cu → NO₂ + Cu²⁺</p>\n            <details class=\"mt-2\">\n              <summary class=\"text-sm text-blue-600 cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-800\">Show Solution</summary>\n              <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                <p>Oxidation: Cu → Cu²⁺ + 2e⁻</p>\n                <p>Reduction: NO₃⁻ + 2H⁺ + e⁻ → NO₂ + H₂O</p>\n                <p>Multiply oxidation by 1, reduction by 2</p>\n                <p class=\"font-semibold mt-2\">2NO₃⁻ + Cu + 4H⁺ → 2NO₂ + Cu²⁺ + 2H₂O</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 6: Key Takeaways -->\n      <section id=\"section-6\" class=\"mb-8\">\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-50 to-purple-50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-violet-200\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-violet-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -star mr-2\" data-mi=\"star\">star</span>Key Takeaways</h3>\n          <ul class=\"text-violet-700 text-sm space-y-2\">\n            <li>• Separate the reaction into oxidation and reduction half-reactions</li>\n            <li>• Balance atoms in order: main element → O (H₂O) → H (H⁺) → charge (e⁻)</li>\n            <li>• Equalize electrons before combining half-reactions</li>\n            <li>• For basic conditions: first balance as acidic, then add OH⁻ to neutralize H⁺</li>\n            <li>• Always verify that both atoms and charges are balanced in the final equation</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Complete Topic Button -->\n      <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"text-center sm:text-left\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800\">Ready to Complete?</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">View all sections, then take the quiz to mark this topic as complete.</p>\n          </div>\n          <button id=\"topic-complete-btn\" disabled=\"\" class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-300 text-gray-500 cursor-not-allowed opacity-50 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-medium\">\n            <span class=\"mi -lock mr-2\" data-mi=\"lock\">lock</span>\n            <span>Complete (0% viewed)</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n  <!-- Topic Tracking and Quiz System -->\n  \n\n\n<div data-bidemy=\"quiz\"></div>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-50 to-purple-100 p-4 md:p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    .content-card {\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    }\n    .accordion-content {\n      max-height: 0;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out;\n    }\n    .accordion-content.open {\n      max-height: 2500px;\n    }\n    .step-card {\n      transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .step-card:hover {\n      transform: translateX(4px);\n    }\n    .viewed-indicator {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    #topic-complete-btn {\n      transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    }\n    #topic-complete-btn:not(:disabled):hover {\n      transform: scale(1.02);\n    }"],"quiz":{"topicId":"balancing-redox","subject":"chemistry","passingScore":60,"questions":[{"question":"What is the first step in balancing a redox equation using the half-reaction method?","options":["Balance the oxygen atoms","Identify and separate oxidation and reduction half-reactions","Add electrons to balance charge","Combine the half-reactions"],"correct":1,"explanation":"The first step is to identify which species are being oxidized and reduced, then separate them into two half-reactions."},{"question":"In acidic solution, how do you balance oxygen atoms in a half-reaction?","options":["Add OH⁻ ions","Add H₂O molecules","Add H⁺ ions","Add O₂ gas"],"correct":1,"explanation":"In acidic conditions, oxygen atoms are balanced by adding H₂O molecules to the side that needs oxygen."},{"question":"Balance: Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺. What is needed?","options":["Add 1 e⁻ to the left","Add 1 e⁻ to the right","Add H⁺ to the left","Add H₂O to the right"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Fe²⁺ loses one electron to become Fe³⁺, so we add 1 e⁻ to the right: Fe²⁺ → Fe³⁺ + e⁻"},{"question":"In basic solution, after balancing as if acidic, what must you do?","options":["Add H⁺ to neutralize OH⁻","Add OH⁻ to both sides to neutralize H⁺","Remove all H⁺ ions","Add more H₂O"],"correct":1,"explanation":"For basic conditions, add the same number of OH⁻ ions to BOTH sides to neutralize any H⁺ ions present."},{"question":"Balance MnO₄⁻ → Mn²⁺ (acidic). How many H⁺ are needed on the left?","options":["4 H⁺","6 H⁺","8 H⁺","2 H⁺"],"correct":2,"explanation":"After balancing O with 4H₂O on the right, we need 8H⁺ on the left: MnO₄⁻ + 8H⁺ → Mn²⁺ + 4H₂O"},{"question":"If the oxidation half-reaction has 2e⁻ and the reduction has 3e⁻, what should you do?","options":["Multiply oxidation by 2, reduction by 3","Multiply oxidation by 3, reduction by 2","Add the electrons together","Subtract the smaller from larger"],"correct":1,"explanation":"To equalize electrons, multiply oxidation by 3 (giving 6e⁻) and reduction by 2 (giving 6e⁻), so the LCM of 2 and 3 is 6."},{"question":"What indicates a correctly balanced redox equation?","options":["Only atoms are balanced","Only charges are balanced","Both atoms and charges are balanced on both sides","The equation has no electrons"],"correct":2,"explanation":"A correctly balanced redox equation must have both atoms AND charges balanced on both sides. Electrons should not appear in the final equation."},{"question":"In the reaction: Cr₂O₇²⁻ + I⁻ → Cr³⁺ + I₂, how many I⁻ ions are in the balanced equation (acidic)?","options":["2 I⁻","4 I⁻","6 I⁻","8 I⁻"],"correct":2,"explanation":"The balanced equation is: Cr₂O₇²⁻ + 6I⁻ + 14H⁺ → 2Cr³⁺ + 3I₂ + 7H₂O, so 6 I⁻ ions are needed."}]},"tracker":{"topicId":"balancing-redox","topicTitle":"Balancing Redox Equations","subject":"chemistry","sections":["section-1","section-2","section-3","section-4","section-5","section-6"],"quizRequired":true},"links":[]}